   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Friday, February 22, 2019 at 7:51:35 AM UTC+11, Terrence Jorgensen wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p></p></div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">The reason for the differences is that texts often repeat only the univariate version of Rubin’s rules, rather than the multivariate extension that pools the entire sampling covariance matrix.</p></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thanks for your reply Terrence. But I don&#39;t understand what you mean by univariate vs multivariate versions of Rubin&#39;s rules.</div><div><br></div><div>In the example I posted, isn&#39;t</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">sqrt(diag(Reduce(&quot;+&quot;, lapply(cfa.imp, vcov))/n.imp +</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">          (1 + 1/n.imp)*cov(t(sapply(cfa.imp, coef)))))</font></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>multivariate because it involves the covariance matrix of all the coefficients?</div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGJsb2NrcXVvdGUgY2xhc3M9ImdtYWlsX3F1b3RlIiBzdHlsZT0ibWFyZ2luOiAwO21hcmdpbi1s\r\nZWZ0OiAwLjhleDtib3JkZXItbGVmdDogMXB4ICNjY2Mgc29saWQ7cGFkZGluZy1sZWZ0OiAxZXg7\r\nIj48ZGl2IGRpcj0ibHRyIj48ZGl2PkknbSB3b25kZXJpbmcgd2h5IHRoZSBzdGFuZGFyZCBlcnJv\r\ncnMgYXJlbid0IGNhbGN1bGF0ZWQgYXMgc3FydChUb3QpLjwvZGl2PjwvZGl2PjwvYmxvY2txdW90\r\nZT48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PlRoZXkgYXJlLCBpbiB0aGUgY29kZSBpbW1lZGlhdGVseSBh\r\nYm92ZSB0aGF0IHdoZXJlIHRoZSBzdGFuZGFyZCBlcnJvcnMgYXJlIGFzc2lnbmVkIHVzaW5nIHRo\r\nZSBgbGF2X21vZGVsX3Zjb3Zfc2UoKWAgZnVuY3Rpb24sIHByb3ZpZGluZyBgVkNPVmAgZnJvbSB0\r\naGUgYHZjb3YoKWAgb3V0cHV0ICh3aGljaCBpcyBpZGVudGljYWwgdG8gYFRvdGAgYXMgY2FsY3Vs\r\nYXRlZCB0aGVyZSB3aGVuIGBzY2FsZS5XPUZBTFNFYCkuJm5ic3A7IE5vdCBzdXJlIHdoeSBJIGtl\r\ncHQgYFRvdGAgaW4gdGhlcmUsIGl0J3MgcHJvYmFibHkganVzdCBhIGxlZ2FjeSBmcm9tIGJlZm9y\r\nZSBJIHdyb3RlIHRoZSBgdmNvdigpYCBtZXRob2QuJm5ic3A7IEJ1dCBgV2AgYW5kIGBCbWAgYXJl\r\nIHRoZXJlIGZvciBjYWxjdWxhdGluZyB0aGUgPGk+ZGY8L2k+LiZuYnNwOyBUaGUgcmVhc29uIGZv\r\nciB0aGUgZGlmZmVyZW5jZXMgaXMgdGhhdCB0ZXh0cyBvZnRlbiByZXBlYXQgb25seSB0aGUgdW5p\r\ndmFyaWF0ZSB2ZXJzaW9uIG9mIFJ1YmluJ3MgcnVsZXMsIHJhdGhlciB0aGFuIHRoZSBtdWx0aXZh\r\ncmlhdGUgZXh0ZW5zaW9uIHRoYXQgcG9vbHMgdGhlIGVudGlyZSBzYW1wbGluZyBjb3ZhcmlhbmNl\r\nIG1hdHJpeC48L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PjxkaXYgc3R5bGU9ImZvbnQtc2l6ZTog\r\nc21hbGw7Ij48ZGl2IHN0eWxlPSJmb250LXNpemU6IDEzcHg7Ij5UZXJyZW5jZSBELiBKb3JnZW5z\r\nZW48L2Rpdj48ZGl2IHN0eWxlPSJmb250LXNpemU6IDEzcHg7Ij5Bc3Npc3RhbnQgUHJvZmVzc29y\r\nLCBNZXRob2RzIGFuZCBTdGF0aXN0aWNzPC9kaXY+PGRpdiBzdHlsZT0iZm9udC1zaXplOiAxM3B4\r\nOyI+UmVzZWFyY2ggSW5zdGl0dXRlIGZvciBDaGlsZCBEZXZlbG9wbWVudCBhbmQgRWR1Y2F0aW9u\r\nLCB0aGUgVW5pdmVyc2l0eSBvZiBBbXN0ZXJkYW08L2Rpdj48ZGl2IHN0eWxlPSJmb250LXN